      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "F23.StringSimilarity.Experimental.Sift4",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/F23.StringSimilarity.Experimental.Sift4.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Sift4 - a general purpose string distance algorithm inspired by JaroWinkler\nand Longest Common Subsequence.\nOriginal JavaScript algorithm by siderite, java port by Nathan Fischer 2016.\n<a href=\"https://siderite.dev/blog/super-fast-and-accurate-string-distance.html\" sourcefile=\"api/F23.StringSimilarity.Experimental.Sift4.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">https://siderite.dev/blog/super-fast-and-accurate-string-distance.html</a>\n<a href=\"https://blackdoor.github.io/blog/sift4-java/\" sourcefile=\"api/F23.StringSimilarity.Experimental.Sift4.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">https://blackdoor.github.io/blog/sift4-java/</a></p>\n"
    },
