      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "F23.StringSimilarity.MetricLCS",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/F23.StringSimilarity.MetricLCS.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Distance metric based on Longest Common Subsequence, from the notes &quot;An\nLCS-based string metric&quot; by Daniel Bakkelund.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/F23.StringSimilarity.NGram.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/F23.StringSimilarity.NGram.html"
        }
